located-reader

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: A public reader that returns one YAML document as located nodes instead of a serde value: each node carries its definition and alias locations, a byte span over the input, its tag and its processed scalar text. It reads through the pipeline from_str_with_options uses, so the budget, alias replay limits, duplicate key policy and multiple document refusal keep one home.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream serde-saphyr offers a located node reader with the same checks.
